## 6. Directory Structure

```
framework/
├── interfaces/
│   └── web_interface.py      # Selenium wrapper
├── pages/
│   ├── <domain>/              # Group pages by domain
│   │   ├── <name>_page.py
│   │   └── <name>_modal.py
│   └── common/                # Shared pages (login, home, etc.)
│       └── home_page.py
├── tasks/
│   ├── <domain>/              # Group tasks by domain
│   │   └── <domain>_tasks.py
│   └── common/                # Shared tasks
│       └── common_tasks.py
├── roles/
│   └── <persona>.py           # User personas (admin, customer, guest)
└── resources/
    └── utilities/             # Helpers
        └── autologger.py

tests/
├── <domain>/
│   ├── data/                  # JSON test data
│   │   └── <test_name>.json
│   └── test_<feature>.py
└── conftest.py                # Pytest fixtures
```

**Example for an e-commerce application:**
```
framework/
├── pages/
│   ├── auth/
